OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA few showers are possible,
OL,6,Fthese mostly through the morning.
OL,7,FOtherwise, most places will have a dry
OL,8,Fday with sunny spells. A little breezy
OL,9,Fin places but feeling warm in the
OL,10,Fsunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FMainly dry this evening and
OL,13,Fovernight with clear periods however
OL,14,Fthe odd shower is possible. Turning
OL,15,Fbreezier but remaining relatively mild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FEarly morning sunny spells
OL,18,Ffading as skies turn mainly cloudy.
OL,19,FThe odd shower is possible, but many
OL,20,Fplaces probably staying dry. Breezy
OL,21,Fbut rather warm for October.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
