OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing southwards on Saturday
OL,7,Fmorning. Drier with sunny spells
OL,8,Fthereafter and onlls on Sunday then
OL,9,Fdamp at times on Monday. Breezy at
OL,10,Ftimes but staying rather warm for
OL,11,FOctober.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
